{"4157300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Farmageddon", "steam_appid": 4157300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME ALIEN FARMHANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/14ca570e13941abc7426d1a8b2f64d93.poster.avif?t=1788166971\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/14ca570e13941abc7426d1a8b2f64d93.webm?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/14ca570e13941abc7426d1a8b2f64d93.mp4?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You and your friends are aliens who got shipped to Earth by a corporation that needs a farm run – cheaply! Every morning a boss barks the day's orders down the terminal, and it's on your crew to deliver. Trouble is, none of you has ever touched a cow, a crop or a bread oven in your life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLANT, MILK, CRAFT AND HAUL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/674ba35bf9d91fe4c816436d07144911.poster.avif?t=1788166971\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/674ba35bf9d91fe4c816436d07144911.webm?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/674ba35bf9d91fe4c816436d07144911.mp4?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sow seeds, milk the cow and shear the sheep – all by yourselves! Bigger orders mean crafting: mill wheat into flour, flour into dough, dough into bread – and every step is a real task you run across the farm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUSH BY DAY, CHILL BY NIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/3511195d1d6cd823ca64641e655ac597.poster.avif?t=1788166971\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/3511195d1d6cd823ca64641e655ac597.webm?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/3511195d1d6cd823ca64641e655ac597.mp4?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When the sun's up it's go-time: crops to gather, orders to fill, and Earth animals trying to wreck it all. Get the goods loaded before the trucks pull out – or explain yourself to the boss. When night falls, the rush is over. It's time to chill and expand the farm, or customize your alien look.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOUR ALIENS, ONE FARM, ZERO PLAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/53a29a2d1ae7b3761b2f14410d016c3d.poster.avif?t=1788166971\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/53a29a2d1ae7b3761b2f14410d016c3d.webm?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/53a29a2d1ae7b3761b2f14410d016c3d.mp4?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split the chores or trip over each other trying! Bump into friends, throw stuff everywhere and snap adorable selfies with your buddies. Yes, you're all new on this farm, but together you'll figure it out!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME ALIEN FARMHANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/14ca570e13941abc7426d1a8b2f64d93.poster.avif?t=1788166971\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/14ca570e13941abc7426d1a8b2f64d93.webm?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/14ca570e13941abc7426d1a8b2f64d93.mp4?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You and your friends are aliens who got shipped to Earth by a corporation that needs a farm run – cheaply! Every morning a boss barks the day's orders down the terminal, and it's on your crew to deliver. Trouble is, none of you has ever touched a cow, a crop or a bread oven in your life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLANT, MILK, CRAFT AND HAUL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/674ba35bf9d91fe4c816436d07144911.poster.avif?t=1788166971\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/674ba35bf9d91fe4c816436d07144911.webm?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/674ba35bf9d91fe4c816436d07144911.mp4?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sow seeds, milk the cow and shear the sheep – all by yourselves! Bigger orders mean crafting: mill wheat into flour, flour into dough, dough into bread – and every step is a real task you run across the farm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUSH BY DAY, CHILL BY NIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/3511195d1d6cd823ca64641e655ac597.poster.avif?t=1788166971\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/3511195d1d6cd823ca64641e655ac597.webm?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/3511195d1d6cd823ca64641e655ac597.mp4?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When the sun's up it's go-time: crops to gather, orders to fill, and Earth animals trying to wreck it all. Get the goods loaded before the trucks pull out – or explain yourself to the boss. When night falls, the rush is over. It's time to chill and expand the farm, or customize your alien look.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOUR ALIENS, ONE FARM, ZERO PLAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/53a29a2d1ae7b3761b2f14410d016c3d.poster.avif?t=1788166971\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/53a29a2d1ae7b3761b2f14410d016c3d.webm?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/extras/53a29a2d1ae7b3761b2f14410d016c3d.mp4?t=1788166971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split the chores or trip over each other trying! Bump into friends, throw stuff everywhere and snap adorable selfies with your buddies. Yes, you're all new on this farm, but together you'll figure it out!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Farmageddon is a 1–4 player co-op sim about clueless aliens shipped to Earth to run a farm for a shady corporation. Grow crops, milk cows, craft goods and load orders into the trucks by day – then rebuild, decorate and chill by night. Frantic by day and cozy by night!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/e934baedbde845d3ed97d8de6bdfe72a6b492df6/header.jpg?t=1788166971", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/ba2fb14fc4bfc105c6514a6c17c270113718570f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788166971", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157300/ba2fb14fc4bfc105c6514a6c17c270113718570f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788166971", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Direct